{"version":1,"content":"<p>《璀璨之城》演員張曦雯（Kelly）、吳卓羲、陳瀅、高海寧和監製陳維冠等，今天（25日）出席劇集宣傳活動。</p><p>陳瀅在劇中有大膽戲分，其中一場戲她僅穿內衣拍攝，事後惹來不少爭議及投訴。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.248366+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:43:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.093740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536855+00:00","content_hash":"a4d99153df5dfa40fafe2205e9c8eca60bad1ead93cf132995475d82a302ecaf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}